2
00:00:01,160 --> 00:00:11,200
Okay, here's his diaper bag, and his, uh, Mr. Winky, and, uh, oh, him, hi.
好的，這是他的尿布袋，還有他的，呃，Winky 先生，還有，呃，哦，他，嗨。

3
00:00:12,340 --> 00:00:13,820
So how'd everything go?
那麼一切進行得怎麼樣？

4
00:00:13,860 --> 00:00:20,020
Oh, great, great. There was a projectile, uh, throwing up incident, but he started it.
哦，太好了，太好了。有一個彈丸，呃，嘔吐事件，但他引發了它。

5
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:22,200
We gotta go.
我們得走了。

6
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:22,600
Okay.
好的。

7
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:28,120
All right, um, I've got some news. It's about us.
好吧，嗯，我有一些訊息。這是關於我們的。

8
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:29,400
Oh, you and me?
哦，你和我？

9
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:31,340
Uh, no, Susan and me.
呃，不，蘇珊和我。

10
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:33,220
The other us.
另一個我們。

11
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:35,140
Okay.
好的。

12
00:00:36,380 --> 00:00:38,940
We're, uh, we're getting married.
我們，呃，我們要結婚了。

13
00:00:45,160 --> 00:00:47,960
As in, I now pronounce you wife and wife married?
比如說，我現在宣佈你們夫妻結婚了？

14
00:00:49,820 --> 00:00:53,560
Anyway, we'd like you to come, but we totally understand if you don't want to.
無論如何，我們希望您能來，但如果您不願意，我們也完全理解。

15
00:00:53,940 --> 00:00:57,240
Yeah, well, why wouldn't I want to come? I had fun at the first wedding.
是啊，那我為什麼不想來呢？我在第一次婚禮上玩得很開心。

16
00:00:57,840 --> 00:01:00,260
Look, I just thought that maybe...
聽著，我只是想也許...

17
00:01:00,260 --> 00:01:03,460
No, no, no, I mean, I, hey, why shouldn't I be happy for you?
不，不，不，我是說，我，嘿，我為什麼不為你感到高興呢？

18
00:01:03,640 --> 00:01:08,220
You know, I mean, what would it say about me if I couldn't, uh, revel in your joy?
你知道，我的意思是，如果我不能，呃，陶醉在你的快樂中，那會對我產生什麼影響？

19
00:01:08,280 --> 00:01:10,280
And I'm, I'm reveling, baby. Believe me.
我，我很陶醉，寶貝。相信我。

20
00:01:11,840 --> 00:01:13,620
Is your finger caught in that chair?
你的手指被那把椅子夾住了嗎？

21
00:01:14,880 --> 00:01:15,220
Mm-hmm.
嗯嗯。

22
00:01:16,160 --> 00:01:16,840
Want us to go?
要我們走嗎？

23
00:01:17,240 --> 00:01:17,560
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

24
00:01:40,040 --> 00:01:42,840
Come on.
快點。

25
00:02:07,380 --> 00:02:10,440
This is so cool. You're actually going to be on television.
這太酷了。你實際上會出現在電視上。

26
00:02:10,960 --> 00:02:15,300
I know. It really hit me last night. I'm going to be on Days of Our Lives.
我知道。昨晚真的讓我很受打擊。我將參加《我們生命中的日子》。

27
00:02:16,420 --> 00:02:21,520
And then I started thinking about all of us and how these are the days of our lives.
然後我開始思考我們所有人以及我們現在的生活。

28
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:25,040
Yes!
是的！

29
00:02:25,640 --> 00:02:25,880
What?
什麼？

30
00:02:26,340 --> 00:02:30,980
Carol and Susan's caterer had a mountain bike accident this weekend, and she's in a full body cast.
卡羅爾和蘇珊的餐飲承辦人本週末發生了一場山地腳踏車事故，而她全身都打著石膏。

31
00:02:33,500 --> 00:02:33,860
Yes!
是的！

32
00:02:35,640 --> 00:02:39,800
They want me to do it, which is really cool, seeing as I've never catered before, and I really need the money.
他們希望我這麼做，這真的很酷，因為我以前從未提供過餐飲服務，而且我真的很需要錢。

33
00:02:39,880 --> 00:02:41,360
And this isn't a problem for you, is it?
這對你來說不是問題，不是嗎？

34
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:42,240
Would it matter?
這有關係嗎？

35
00:02:42,480 --> 00:02:44,540
Oh, you were so great. Thank you.
哦，你真是太棒了。謝謝。

36
00:02:45,440 --> 00:02:46,500
You really not going?
你真的不去嗎？

37
00:02:46,640 --> 00:02:51,040
I'm really not going. I mean, I don't get it. They already live together. Why do they need to get married?
我真的不去了。我的意思是，我不明白。他們已經住在一起了。他們為什麼需要結婚？

38
00:02:52,020 --> 00:02:56,720
Because they love each other, and they want to celebrate that love with the people that are close with them.
因為他們彼此相愛，他們想與親近的人一起慶祝這種愛。

39
00:02:57,960 --> 00:02:59,360
If you want to call that a reason.
如果你想稱其為理由的話。

40
00:03:01,600 --> 00:03:03,840
Who's the bitterest man in the living room?
客廳裡最兇狠的人是誰？

41
00:03:05,520 --> 00:03:07,500
The bitterest man in the living room.
客廳裡最苦毒的男人。

42
00:03:09,420 --> 00:03:09,980
Hi, neighbor.
嗨，鄰居。

43
00:03:13,120 --> 00:03:14,680
Ross, I thought you were over this.
羅斯，我以為你已經結束了。

44
00:03:14,760 --> 00:03:17,800
That has nothing to do with this, okay? She's my ex-wife.
這和這個沒關係吧？她是我的前妻。

45
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:20,960
If she were marrying a guy, none of you would expect me to be there.
如果她要嫁給一個男人，你們誰也不會想到我會在那裡。

46
00:03:21,160 --> 00:03:24,760
Hey, if she were marrying a guy, she'd be, like, the worst lesbian ever.
嘿，如果她嫁給一個男人，她就會成為有史以來最糟糕的女同性戀。

47
00:03:27,760 --> 00:03:29,400
Did I miss it? Did I miss it?
我錯過了嗎？我錯過了嗎？

48
00:03:29,540 --> 00:03:31,660
No, no, I'm on right after this guy shoots himself.
不，不，這傢伙開槍自殺後我就開始了。

49
00:03:33,420 --> 00:03:34,500
Whoa, she's pretty.
哇，她很漂亮。

50
00:03:35,020 --> 00:03:35,380
Yeah.
是的。

51
00:03:35,620 --> 00:03:37,160
Oh, and she's really nice, too.
哦，她也很好。

52
00:03:37,480 --> 00:03:42,020
She taught me all about, you know, how to work with the cameras and smell the fart acting.
她教會了我所有關於如何使用攝影機和聞屁表演的知識。

53
00:03:45,200 --> 00:03:46,340
I'm sorry, what?
對不起，什麼？

54
00:03:46,640 --> 00:03:46,920
What, Susie?
什麼，蘇西？

55
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:49,220
Smell the fart acting.
聞屁表演。

56
00:03:51,340 --> 00:03:57,880
It's like you got so many lines to learn so fast that sometimes you need a minute to remember your next one.
就好像你有太多臺詞要學得那麼快，有時你需要一分鐘才能記住下一句。

57
00:03:58,280 --> 00:04:02,920
So while you're thinking of it, you take this big pause where you look all intense.
所以當你思考這個問題的時候，你會停頓一下，看起來很緊張。

58
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:04,120
You know, like this.
你知道，就像這樣。

59
00:04:09,160 --> 00:04:09,640
Okay.
好的。

60
00:04:11,460 --> 00:04:12,880
Oh, here's my scene, here's my scene.
哦，這是我的場景，這是我的場景。

61
00:04:16,280 --> 00:04:17,100
Mrs. Wallace?
華萊士夫人？

62
00:04:17,340 --> 00:04:17,700
Yes.
是的。

63
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:20,940
I'm Dr. Drake Remora, your sister's neurosurgeon.
我是德雷克·雷莫拉醫生，你姐姐的神經外科醫生。

64
00:04:21,120 --> 00:04:22,900
Tell me, is she going to be all right?
告訴我，她會好嗎？

65
00:04:23,320 --> 00:04:26,300
I'm afraid the situation is much more dire than we'd expected.
恐怕情況比我們預想的要嚴峻得多。

66
00:04:27,180 --> 00:04:30,800
Your sister is suffering from a...
你的妹妹患有...

67
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:36,640
a subcranial hematoma.
顱下血腫。

68
00:04:40,280 --> 00:04:43,680
Perhaps we can discuss this further over coffee.
也許我們可以一邊喝咖啡一邊進一步討論這個問題。

69
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:50,280
Oh, nice.
哦，不錯。

70
00:04:50,840 --> 00:04:51,640
Yeah, excellent.
是的，非常好。

71
00:04:52,320 --> 00:04:54,960
You know, for a minute there I thought you were actually trying to smell something.
你知道，有一分鐘我以為你真的想聞什麼味道。

72
00:04:58,680 --> 00:04:59,380
That's great.
那太棒了。

73
00:04:59,560 --> 00:04:59,840
Do it.
做吧。

74
00:05:00,040 --> 00:05:00,780
It's so good.
太好了。

75
00:05:00,840 --> 00:05:01,340
Do it again.
再做一次。

76
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:02,460
All right, all right, all right.
好吧，好吧，好吧。

77
00:05:03,500 --> 00:05:05,340
Dammit, Braverman, it's right there on the chart.
該死的，佈雷弗曼，它就在圖表上。

78
00:05:05,460 --> 00:05:05,720
Yeah.
是的。

79
00:05:07,840 --> 00:05:08,580
That's great.
那太棒了。

80
00:05:08,780 --> 00:05:09,720
All right, I've got to get to work.
好吧，我得去工作了。

81
00:05:09,780 --> 00:05:11,560
I've got a big dinosaur bone to inspect.
我有一塊大恐龍骨頭要檢查。

82
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:13,280
No, no, no, that's me.
不不不，這就是我。

83
00:05:13,400 --> 00:05:13,900
Oh, right.
哦，對了。

84
00:05:17,080 --> 00:05:18,140
Oh, whoa.
哦，哇。

85
00:05:18,320 --> 00:05:19,460
Oh, thanks.
哦，謝謝。

86
00:05:19,780 --> 00:05:20,720
Couldn't, uh...
不能，呃...

87
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:24,820
Is everything okay?
一切都好嗎？

88
00:05:25,220 --> 00:05:26,220
Um, no.
嗯，不。

89
00:05:26,580 --> 00:05:26,880
Uh-uh.
呃呃。

90
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:27,960
Um...
嗯...

91
00:05:28,960 --> 00:05:32,100
One of my clients died on the massage table today.
今天我的一位客戶死在按摩床上。

92
00:05:32,460 --> 00:05:32,720
Oh.
哦。

93
00:05:32,900 --> 00:05:33,640
Oh, my God.
我的天啊。

94
00:05:33,640 --> 00:05:36,280
Well, that's a little more relaxed than you want them to get.
嗯，這比你希望他們得到的要輕鬆一些。

95
00:05:37,820 --> 00:05:38,780
Yeah, uh-huh.
是啊，嗯。

96
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:41,940
Um, she was, you know, 82 years old,
嗯，你知道，她已經 82 歲了，

97
00:05:42,340 --> 00:05:46,120
and, um, her name was, um, Mrs. Edelman.
而且，嗯，她的名字是，嗯，艾德曼夫人。

98
00:05:46,640 --> 00:05:47,500
Oh, honey.
哦，親愛的。

99
00:05:47,840 --> 00:05:49,420
Yeah, it's just so strange.
是的，這太奇怪了。

100
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:51,960
I mean, you know, she probably woke up this morning and thought,
我的意思是，你知道，她今天早上醒來可能會想，

101
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:54,700
all right, so I'll have some breakfast and I'll take a little walk
好吧，我去吃點早餐，然後散散步

102
00:05:54,700 --> 00:05:56,940
and, you know, then I'll have my massage.
然後，你知道，然後我就去做按摩。

103
00:05:57,540 --> 00:06:00,300
Little did she know, God was thinking, okay, but that's it.
她幾乎不知道，上帝在想，好吧，但僅此而已。

104
00:06:03,760 --> 00:06:06,320
Oh, but the weirdest thing was, okay,
哦，但最奇怪的是，好吧，

105
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:09,500
I was cleansing her aura when it happened,
事情發生時我正在淨化她的氣場，

106
00:06:10,060 --> 00:06:13,260
and when her spirit left her body,
當她的靈魂離開她的身體時，

107
00:06:13,500 --> 00:06:15,360
I don't think it went very far.
我不認為它走得太遠。

108
00:06:17,020 --> 00:06:17,940
What do you mean?
你是什麼意思？

109
00:06:18,940 --> 00:06:20,900
I think it went into me.
我想它進入了我的內心。

110
00:06:29,720 --> 00:06:31,220
God, this is so hard.
天哪，這太難了。

111
00:06:31,220 --> 00:06:33,520
I can't decide between lamb or duck.
我無法決定是羊肉還是鴨肉。

112
00:06:33,840 --> 00:06:35,300
Well, of course, lambs are scarier.
嗯，當然，羔羊更可怕。

113
00:06:35,780 --> 00:06:38,040
Otherwise, the movie would have been called Silence of the Ducks.
否則，這部電影就會被稱為《鴨子沉默》。

114
00:06:40,560 --> 00:06:41,780
Okay, who ordered what?
好吧，誰點了什麼？

115
00:06:42,380 --> 00:06:46,220
Oh, I believe I had the half-drunk cappuccino with the lipstick on the rim.
哦，我想我喝了半醉的卡布奇諾，邊緣有口紅。

116
00:06:47,260 --> 00:06:50,320
Yes, and this with the cigarette butt in it, is that decaf?
是的，這裡面有菸頭，是不含咖啡因的嗎？

117
00:06:51,220 --> 00:06:52,020
Oh, God.
哦，上帝。

118
00:06:52,600 --> 00:06:54,800
I can't believe you're so uptight about your mom coming.
我不敢相信你對你媽媽的到來如此緊張。

119
00:06:55,100 --> 00:06:57,180
I know, but it's just, it's the first time,
我知道，但這只是第一次

120
00:06:57,240 --> 00:06:59,420
and I just don't want her to think that because I didn't marry Barry,
我只是不想讓她認為因為我沒有嫁給巴里

121
00:06:59,420 --> 00:07:01,160
my life is total crap, you know?
我的生活一團糟，你知道嗎？

122
00:07:01,380 --> 00:07:02,600
Don't talk about crap.
別說廢話了

123
00:07:02,840 --> 00:07:04,300
Try listening to Stella Niedman
試著聽聽斯特拉·尼德曼的聲音

124
00:07:04,300 --> 00:07:07,520
tell the story of her and Rod Steiger for the hundredth time.
第一百次講述她和羅德‧斯泰格的故事。

125
00:07:12,420 --> 00:07:13,300
I'm sorry.
對不起。

126
00:07:14,140 --> 00:07:16,640
At least you guys don't have to hear the stuff she says in my head.
至少你們不必聽到她在我腦子裡說的話。

127
00:07:20,300 --> 00:07:23,600
Uh, Pheebs, how long do you think this lady will be with us?
呃，菲比，你認為這位女士會和我們在一起多久？

128
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:25,580
I don't know.
我不知道。

129
00:07:26,080 --> 00:07:28,440
I mean, she obviously has some kind of unfinished business.
我的意思是，她顯然還有一些未完成的事情。

130
00:07:28,440 --> 00:07:29,840
Sit up.
坐起來。

131
00:07:32,740 --> 00:07:34,380
There she is.
她就在那裡。

132
00:07:34,440 --> 00:07:35,020
Mom!
媽媽！

133
00:07:35,420 --> 00:07:35,720
Sweetie!
親愛的！

134
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:44,540
So this is where you work.
所以這就是你工作的地方。

135
00:07:45,320 --> 00:07:46,800
Oh, it's wonderful.
哦，太棒了。

136
00:07:47,700 --> 00:07:49,680
Is it a living room? Is it a restaurant?
是客廳嗎？這是一家餐廳嗎？

137
00:07:50,200 --> 00:07:50,980
Who can tell?
誰能告訴我？

138
00:07:52,180 --> 00:07:53,380
Well, I guess that's the fun.
嗯，我想這就是樂趣所在。

139
00:07:53,720 --> 00:07:54,920
Pretty much.
差不多了。

140
00:07:55,260 --> 00:07:56,080
Here, meet my friends.
在這裡，認識我的朋友們。

141
00:07:56,500 --> 00:07:57,080
Monica!
莫妮卡！

142
00:07:57,080 --> 00:07:58,680
You look gorgeous!
你看起來很漂亮！

143
00:07:59,100 --> 00:08:02,200
Oh, my, the last time I saw you, it was eat or be eaten.
哦，天哪，我上次見到你，是在吃或被吃。

144
00:08:04,400 --> 00:08:05,660
Uh, this is Joey.
呃，這是喬伊。

145
00:08:05,860 --> 00:08:06,400
Hi, hi.
嗨，嗨。

146
00:08:06,400 --> 00:08:07,260
This is Phoebe.
這是菲比。

147
00:08:07,620 --> 00:08:08,880
And this is Chandler.
這是錢德勒。

148
00:08:09,120 --> 00:08:10,260
And you remember Ross?
你還記得羅斯嗎？

149
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:11,420
Oh, hello, Ross.
哦，你好，羅斯。

150
00:08:11,440 --> 00:08:12,060
Hi, Mrs. McGregor.
嗨，麥格雷戈夫人。

151
00:08:14,580 --> 00:08:19,760
So, what do you think of my daughter in the apron with the big jaw?
那麼，你覺得我穿圍裙、大下巴的女兒怎麼樣呢？

152
00:08:20,100 --> 00:08:21,140
Oh, Mom!
哦，媽媽！

153
00:08:21,520 --> 00:08:21,960
Okay.
好的。

154
00:08:22,820 --> 00:08:26,760
If you didn't pour the coffee, no one would have anything to drink.
如果你不倒咖啡，就沒人喝了。

155
00:08:27,700 --> 00:08:29,640
Believe me, sometimes that happens.
相信我，有時會發生這種情況。

156
00:08:32,160 --> 00:08:34,000
This is just so exciting.
這太令人興奮了。

157
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:35,760
You know, I never worked.
你知道，我從來沒有工作過。

158
00:08:36,180 --> 00:08:40,280
I went straight from my father's house to the sorority house to my husband's house.
我直接從父親家到聯誼會，再到我先生家。

159
00:08:40,740 --> 00:08:43,180
I am just so proud of you.
我為你感到驕傲。

160
00:08:43,460 --> 00:08:44,180
Oh, really?
哦真的嗎？

161
00:08:44,580 --> 00:08:44,960
Yes.
是的。

162
00:08:45,400 --> 00:08:46,840
Oh, let's make a day of it.
